as-i386 follow-up work
======================

- Add the remaining GNU as 32-bit encodings beyond the classic IA-32 scope:
  AES/PCLMUL, BMI/BMI2, AVX/AVX2, FMA, XOP and the VEX/EVEX/APX/AVX-512
  families.  This requires a separate VEX/EVEX-capable operand and prefix
  encoder; unsupported -march extensions must remain hard errors until their
  instruction and negative-gate matrices are complete.
